# AIOS Silicon Lattice — NVIDIA GPU + AMD chip session
silicon probe
silicon declare nvidia gpu rtx0 24576 128 :: NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090
silicon declare amd cpu zen0 65536 32 :: AMD Ryzen 9 7950X
silicon declare amd gpu rx0 16384 96 :: AMD Radeon RX 7900 XTX
silicon list
spawn trainer :: fine-tune LLM on CUDA
silicon bind trainer rtx0
silicon accel trainer matmul batch-1024
silicon unbind trainer
silicon bind trainer zen0
silicon accel trainer tokenize corpus
silicon bind trainer rx0
silicon accel trainer hip-gemm layer-norm
explain silicon
status
